36381-b00031","start":232,"end":410,"exact":"While the most favorite message of the holiday month is sharing joy with family and friends, the celebration of the end of the month focused on faith, humility and renunciation. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:e10940a3a24409f83d82aa718d0e28147ed78d2b5305a879edcd5dab63c4531d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:b73ab00c514dbbf600be2707a54e6c3f","blockId":"gv-736381-b00031","start":410,"end":499,"exact":"In this sense, the spirit of Ramadan along with the philosophy of Islam teaches patience."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:2de1385018e53c43694b1b13f8811cca82f52b85e66ff5c78ae2887ce1649f03","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:b73ab00c514dbbf600be2707a54e6c3f","blockId":"gv-736381-b00032","start":0,"end":35,"exact":"As Kamila, a Czech Muslim, puts it:"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:0465a8855b61c2e6a15175508f94e7e920f6ef6c7bf03ac533fa9a27bd08a4ca","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:b73ab00c514dbbf600be2707a54e6c3f","blockId":"gv-736381-b00033","start":0,"end":53,"exact":"> “Islam actually shows the true nature of a person”."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:b6dbc18dc0b01260cac669b8d2560ea4","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"b6dbc18dc0b01260cac669b8d2560ea4","outcome":"does_not_meet","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-hostility:discrimination_claim:2026-03-operational-1:794fad83018ea1e0de86fe60ff7dec7a18160eddcba979e1750fdd782a8456f3","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:b73ab00c514dbbf600be2707a54e6c3f:u_d25767b87e1769eb0b405372","attribution":"unknown","speaker":"Unknown","speakerStance":"not_applicable","documentStance":"not_applicable","proposition":"","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","unitContext":["urn:doxa:passage:f2f50e1fe6454cf72ffb2e5ec10c07b128f4a180294833ae08c42771106aae78","urn:doxa:passage:2001079da39ad41460a31ab8fb659cadc2bc864fece36e9db831