Ayat Qadomee"],"publishedOn":"2021-06-20","sourceUrl":"https://globalvoices.org/2021/06/20/balloons-graffiti-sports-and-economic-power-are-the-latest-tools-of-palestinian-resistance/","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/","contentSha256":"128a89e15b9a6d0111b79a78135c97ed0cb047c610c7f0b5d8c84a5e6f946a0a","textSha256":"dc3aadc4e1b3e03775b169c38422d2c24e7a4edda2914b31a3547d7367d9c7c5","archivedRecordSha256":"f13133ea61afa825aa434881cbe0eed3738fe1dc0491a3207fe490258bd46b04","inStudy":"urn:doxa:study:muslim-coverage-1"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:unit:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10:u_93644c39a189e441280790dd","@type":["doxa:SourceUnit","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"u_93644c39a189e441280790dd","status":"accepted","fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:unit:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10:u_fd2e22bf5a77c6927440f2b6","@type":["doxa:SourceUnit","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"u_fd2e22bf5a77c6927440f2b6","status":"accepted","fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:fa743bdadc2741a7e13992ab8e621ac4b633ad8fe57a04dc24eba74b31192032","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00014","start":304,"end":328,"exact":"Allah knows who we are”."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:b6831f3ec6be985c810bb4c4865450f7ffca5515f5bbbaa7621a541c9467416d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00015","start":0,"end":58,"exact":"Referring to the popularity of the clip, Mona Hawwa wrote:"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:af9dd482f89118c38cd5604fb7f87f400e88b46d4c3d695706d056c846a2a59e","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00016","start":0,"end":24,"exact":"> An image you can hear."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:1bf2d7abf667985607f691ce62f6082060ffd37c523fc83fa5d9f250f29e7ffd","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00017","start":0,"end":30,"exact":"Meanwhile, Yahia Alaa tweeted:"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:40621969da4661daca9be0fba9e6d99431b96a3a6c2785c249ae31c691bfb4db","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00018","start":0,"end":110,"exact":"> Daboor & Shabjdeed's song “Inn Ann” is the song of this phase, and a confirmation that nations still resist."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:80f8d6bee7a08a72768647deb8b2e21b8c4259becf6f334b60546bc748697881","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00019","start":0,"end":221,"exact":"Palestinians also expressed their rejection of their displacement by the Israeli state by organizing the “Jerusalem Marathon” on June 4 between Sheikh Jarrah and Silwan, neighbourhoods whose residents are being displaced."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:e9222cf1cbc06f92795fe00375b60b0f4c8c8362ab6f5a6f701f3ea0549c9775","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00020","start":0,"end":78,"exact":"> From the starting point of Jerusalem Marathon in Sheikh Jarrah neighbourhood"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:9c5ce16e8b8df0b6d008f392dc75ee7b2c33ff36f97c2ebede755f60e56b5221","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00021","start":0,"end":177,"exact":"As participants arrived at the protest tent in Batn Al-Hawa neighbourhood in Silwan, Occupation forces broke into the gathering, assaulting individuals and destroying the tent. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:2fd948546d593b0c7e21112f321d2ccababfdcd48929956b8fcfae73248f7d87","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00021","start":177,"end":242,"exact":"This was all filmed by the United Palestinians Digital Community."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:d12c5f6827de8fc54a22131ae5fb0488f3e445d823821c2511123d2286249931","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00022","start":0,"end":167,"exact":"> Occupation forces destroy the solidarity tent at Batn-Al Hawa neighbourhood in Silwan after their barbaric assault on people and participants of “Jerusalem Marathon”"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:7d2093a7a0fa665aa9a7a3ffbffc02c7015ab2aa5e329fa102f2d6cb1b9f40b4","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00023","start":0,"end":33,"exact":"Later the account also published:"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:4141a53cb0c27dc3318adac28cada6d0cb41c240c527819766118aedca9771a3","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00024","start":0,"end":145,"exact":"> Participants of Jerusalem Marathon celebrate after the withdrawal of the colonial forces from the protesting tent at Batn Al-Hawa neighborhood."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:e1cc6b9ae0a5bd698369b03a764cde32a05c3ae962df5df3e766e156e78c0e96","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00025","start":0,"end":161,"exact":"In the northern city of Acre, artists and musicians organized a protest festival featuring artistic performances, poetry, and agricultural and theater workshops."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:89555520d83da2e19adf89bb11bdc36a4262529a3feadd92dcada348f256aa92","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00026","start":0,"end":265,"exact":"> Schedule of the “Acre on my Head” artistic protest which will launch tomorrow Saturday 5.6.21 from Al-Jazzar Mosque Square and will go on in: Al-Shouna, Al-Mbalta, Phosphlone and Al-Fakhura neighborhoods with the participation of a group of artists and musicians."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:88ae821ff69809fc27dd9df5e1c90da4a196e81b07e66c8f97eca82e46c91609","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00027","start":0,"end":32,"exact":"> Hashtag: I hope I was with you"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:b8fe0056f58286f567772b37fb13dfe47edf65e6c387301f2fe323a3722a0c68","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00028","start":0,"end":66,"exact":"Creative resistance to the occupation also took an economic form. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:e280b888c005462d875157f0356d7e4f4e62eb159a8f8a065eb8df082543f515","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00028","start":66,"end":250,"exact":"A “National Economy Week” campaign was initiated to encourage Palestinians in the Occupied Territories to promote Palestinian suppliers, merchants, and manufacturers between June 6-12."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:7629e5d7d21aa4e368f50cabe0d6fa5032e4d587e52cd1f16f99b2ee8751d203","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00029","start":0,"end":311,"exact":"This campaign conveyed to the Palestinian residents of the 1948 Occupied Territories the important message that they held the power to undermine the Israeli economy by supporting Palestinian businesses, which are already subjected to state measures designed to keep Palestine's economy controlled and dependent."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:280a509b54c425ad0c39e75c3a869b9425e0a59d6e6d27d83113a58d36b135ab","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00030","start":0,"end":176,"exact":"Haifa-based activist, journalist, and novelist Majd Kayyal played a key role in the “National Economy Week” campaign, publishing daily Facebook posts that reinforced its goals."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:91f51f2e56820397a68f96e94ae5c6dae8f91d92f57c3ee748a77d11182ec7a0","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00031","start":0,"end":244,"exact":"This campaign's hashtag was also used to shed light on the struggles of those living in the cities of occupied Palestine, such as fishermen in Acre, who are subject to many restrictions imposed by the local municipal authorities and the state. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:4fff4577df11d55746eada511eedbda2d2041c0765f09ef56a184ebdbfca1dbb","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00031","start":244,"end":349,"exact":"This tweet refers to the costly fines that could be imposed on fishermen at the whims of state employees."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:da353d274afca593444d3230147b277f9ea1234e6207006f68a7247f1d7a9a17","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00032","start":0,"end":210,"exact":"> About the Occupation’s pursuit of the fishing sector in Acre, and its continuous restrictions to empty the sea of those who lived for decades riding its waves and eating its fish, what do Acre fishermen face?"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:32458fcbeaf747b57852f07d0930ee7e1764632c1091fed47c102fefa57a817c","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00033","start":0,"end":177,"exact":"These latest acts of resistance reflect the energy brought to the movement by young people seeking their right to self-determination and to claim the spaces in which they live. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:4b88f2b970614a0f285ad7dae40fb40bafb1d92fc897daef38d1637b16aae259","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10","blockId":"gv-739144-b00033","start":177,"end":219,"exact":"To all Palestinians, this represents hope."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:c0c15c9d1aeeac4be9ec8b006ce76e03","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"c0c15c9d1aeeac4be9ec8b006ce76e03","outcome":"does_not_meet","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-hostility:discrimination_claim:2026-03-operational-1:794fad83018ea1e0de86fe60ff7dec7a18160eddcba979e1750fdd782a8456f3","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:8167cd1ad56c98dc70de4ce56500cb10:u_93644c39a189e441280790dd","attribution":"unknown","speaker":"Unknown","speakerStance":"not_applicable","documentStance":"not_applicable","proposition":"","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","unitContext":["urn:doxa:passage:fa743bdadc2741a7e13992ab8e621ac4b633ad8fe57a04dc24eba74b31192032","urn:doxa:passage:b6831f3ec6be985c810bb4c4865450f7ffca5515f5bbbaa7621a541c9467416d","urn:doxa:passage:af9dd482f89118c38cd5604fb7f87f400e88b46d4c3d695706d056c846a2a59e","urn:doxa:passage:1bf2d7abf667985607f691ce62f6082060ffd37c523fc83fa5d9f250f29e7ffd","urn:doxa:passage:40621969da4661daca9be0fba9e6d99431b96a3a6c2785c249ae31c691bfb4db","urn:doxa:passage:80f8d6bee7a08a72768647deb8b2e21b8c4259becf6f334b60546bc748697881","urn:doxa:passage:e9222cf1cbc06f92795fe00375b60b0f4c8c8362ab6f5a6f701f3ea0549c9775","urn:doxa:passage:9c5ce16e8b8df0b6d008f392dc75ee7b2c33ff36f97c2ebede755f60e56b5221","urn:doxa:passage:2fd948546d593b0c7e21112f321d2ccababfdcd48929956b8fcfae73248f7d87","urn:doxa:passage:d12c5f6827de8fc54a22131ae5fb0488f3e445d823821c2511123d2286249931","urn:doxa:passage:7d2093a7a0fa665aa9a7a3ffbffc02c7015ab2aa5e329fa102f2d6cb1b9f40b4","urn:doxa:passage:4141a53cb0c27dc3318adac28cada6d0cb41c240c527819766118aedca9771a3","urn:doxa:passage:e1cc6b9ae0a5bd698369b03a764cd