tionalists use Instagram","author":"Civic Media Observatory","translator":[],"publishedOn":"2022-02-22","sourceUrl":"https://globalvoices.org/2022/02/22/undertones-how-extremist-hindu-nationalists-use-instagram/","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/","contentSha256":"d0b9e88d003f1b0ee3a94da2afb7f0d7d0d08db88bdc379250fa303972fae2e9","textSha256":"c0c7959b855aa8d1d7a6d4f449743fe618a71c552d1f3a73726d4e0da40dcf13","archivedRecordSha256":"0573d3b0312bfadd315702a73f28cdb2df5053cd5e5e0a736df1f98e2b9d7096","inStudy":"urn:doxa:study:muslim-coverage-1"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:unit:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e:u_823943c59ec66ed355227580","@type":["doxa:SourceUnit","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"u_823943c59ec66ed355227580","status":"accepted","fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:unit:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e:u_f00916bf94db56f58af165ca","@type":["doxa:SourceUnit","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"u_f00916bf94db56f58af165ca","status":"accepted","fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:a922f6dc29de2788e2e2e0614ed6d6eec15c08da2eb1cbfea123fdf839ddecdd","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00006","start":124,"end":279,"exact":"In addition to Muslims, Christians, Buddhists, and Dalits are being attacked physically and online, as well as discriminated against by the country’s laws."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:65590378335f6fa049a22ec117cc3e89","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"65590378335f6fa049a22ec117cc3e89","outcome":"meets_criterion","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-hostility:discrimination_claim:2026-03-operational-1:794fad83018ea1e0de86fe60ff7dec7a18160eddcba979e1750fdd782a8456f3","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e:u_823943c59ec66ed355227580","attribution":"reported_speaker","speaker":"Civic Media Observatory","speakerStance":"neutral","documentStance":"neutral","proposition":"Muslims are being physically and online attacked and discriminated against by laws.","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","explanation":"The text reports that Muslims are being discriminated against by the country's laws and physically attacked. (s_454b05166918ccd07b90ce84)","modelPassage":["urn:doxa:passage:a922f6dc29de2788e2e2e0614ed6d6eec15c08da2eb1cbfea123fdf839ddecdd"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:76277e5e10a25939a5a7c033b971c8d201a584149c986b627077a334ac40e927","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00018","start":0,"end":178,"exact":"In Gopal’s video on Instagram, a group of men is shown walking through a Muslim neighborhood chanting what appear to be Hindutva and religious slogans in a show of intimidation. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:154a435071f5af51bac58402b2cede7a","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"154a435071f5af51bac58402b2cede7a","outcome":"meets_criterion","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-hostility:stereotyping_and_intent:2026-03-operational-1:07d629353e1806de5b8b1a9c1b3000a003614c74470cf23c5ebe4839ea602097","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e:u_823943c59ec66ed355227580","attribution":"reported_speaker","speaker":"Rambhakt Gopal (via video)","speakerStance":"unclear","documentStance":"neutral","proposition":"Men chanting in a Muslim neighborhood is a show of intimidation.","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","explanation":"The text describes a video of men chanting in a Muslim neighborhood, which the author identifies as a show of intimidation.","modelPassage":["urn:doxa:passage:76277e5e10a25939a5a7c033b971c8d201a584149c986b627077a334ac40e927"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:f3f9b97387e1794e746aac244a683163","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"f3f9b97387e1794e746aac244a683163","outcome":"meets_criterion","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-hostility:targeted_hostility:2026-03-operational-1:72f7ea3551be2ef7fd32d774ee261f75056cf16c773d8b5a2d7a194b6c879a2d","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e:u_823943c59ec66ed355227580","attribution":"reported_speaker","speaker":"Rambhakt Gopal (via video)","speakerStance":"unclear","documentStance":"neutral","proposition":"A group of men is walking through a Muslim neighborhood chanting slogans to intimidate.","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","explanation":"The article reports on a video showing men walking through a Muslim neighborhood chanting slogans as a show of intimidation.","modelPassage":["urn:doxa:passage:76277e5e10a25939a5a7c033b971c8d201a584149c986b627077a334ac40e927"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:42f62ca2c0845fc2d15f4b45e325708bce224a49efc6cc7117b34e141d058407","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00007","start":145,"end":255,"exact":"Calls for the genocide of minorities, attacks on mosques, and the closing of churches are increasingly common."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:4a10c6517bf89bbab70be8559309ef7d","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"4a10c6517bf89bbab70be8559309ef7d","outcome":"meets_criterion","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-racism:exclusion:2025-operational-1:58af664b53f3bbc982a55b72222757384bb7ee5f78fe0304068038feb47eafe4","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e:u_823943c59ec66ed355227580","attribution":"reported_speaker","speaker":"Civic Media Observatory","speakerStance":"neutral","documentStance":"neutral","proposition":"There are increasing calls for attacks on mosques.","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","explanation":"The text reports on increasing calls for the closing of churches and attacks on mosques, which relates to religious/communal exclusion. (s_a2abdb66c69010bbd4373e2d)","modelPassage":["urn:doxa:passage:42f62ca2c0845fc2d15f4b45e325708bce224a49efc6cc7117b34e141d058407"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:54b7aa970169c9a870e2573d8309aadb","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"54b7aa970169c9a870e2573d8309aadb","outcome":"meets_criterion","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-racism:institutional_pattern:2025-operational-1:ecbb016b6baf762e73d31e3b32c63b7fc6774025c77f32ff9fd824284fb4ac7b","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e:u_823943c59ec66ed355227580","attribution":"reported_speaker","speaker":"Civic Media Observatory","speakerStance":"neutral","documentStance":"neutral","proposition":"Minorities are discriminated against by the country's laws.","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","explanation":"The text reports that religious minorities, including Muslims, face physical and online attacks as well as discrimination through the country's laws.","modelPassage":["urn:doxa:passage:a922f6dc29de2788e2e2e0614ed6d6eec15c08da2eb1cbfea123fdf839ddecdd"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:60de4203b0b4ae73902474441ff27cccf2b5de5ecf63f78be4bd828db3aafa9e","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00004","start":0,"end":252,"exact":"Accounts such as “World of Hindus” and “not_a_liberal-” use sexist, casteist, and communalist memes and comments, manipulated videos, and disinformation to mobilize people to attack minorities and join the campaign to establish a Hindu nation in India."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:4ee9c3b56ffb23bd8f969843ddd3a208","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"4ee9c3b56ffb23bd8f969843ddd3a208","outcome":"meets_criterion","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-racism:racialization:2025-operational-1:22ba2440d280286f7582830210857fa8b3d81eaaa16f9803c2cd8ab087e9a643","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e:u_823943c59ec66ed355227580","attribution":"reported_speaker","speaker":"Civic Media Observatory","speakerStance":"neutral","documentStance":"neutral","proposition":"Communalist propaganda and intimidation are used against minorities and Muslim neighborhoods.","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","explanation":"The article reports on accounts using communalist memes to mobilize attacks on minorities and shows men intimidating a Muslim neighborhood. (s_49c75e2ce9330f44cdc9e4e0, s_861bb5c0308de1609190bef3)","modelPassage":["urn:doxa:passage:60de4203b0b4ae73902474441ff27cccf2b5de5ecf63f78be4bd828db3aafa9e","urn:doxa:passage:76277e5e10a25939a5a7c033b971c8d201a584149c986b627077a334ac40e927"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:ba25b9cf69218435458390ad32c3b9c21009fff2258642e350aaaa0de4381daf","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00019","start":0,"end":70,"exact":"In 2020, Gopal was photographed pointing a gun at student protesters. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:c5ed683835b7de9135f322cf97b3d4fbe6212b8d4f15cb1447c168f762ac5c2d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00019","start":70,"end":163,"exact":"He was released and acquitted of all charges despite evidence that he was inciting violence. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:050508149354e809612a076372d16f52d803a473221b2854d3b08f2e379ce8a6","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00019","start":163,"end":248,"exact":"According to Delhi police, Gopal was radicalized by “viewing videos on social media.”"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:e6870e6e09904204b5d43826af198b1bcfe68c16ad57dfdead3bf7a37742283c","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00020","start":0,"end":249,"exact":"The BJP and other political movements have introduced and normalized a strong Islamophobic narrative, blaming Muslims for violence against Hindus, and manipulating the public into thinking that Hindus are under threat and need to protect themselves."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:9c8a14990cd47d47272a37f2be4fc8b8c4cf48855baaf89f43d6ba4c63da6ac7","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00021","start":0,"end":181,"exact":"The narratives expressed in this post are: “Enemies of Hindutva are enemies of India”, “Hindus are under threat”, and “Only BJP can save India and lead it towards Hindu prosperity.”"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:594cf22f7515b88c1a57a52a29521b6a55ad1037a05518ff6f5abaddf510e3a5","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00022","start":0,"end":32,"exact":"More analysis of this item here."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:82b88871e200cf33d7fe30212478aed8715ff0fdcababd6fc8b51789a4234dc0","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00023","start":0,"end":31,"exact":"”Hindu men saving Muslim women”"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:8eddff6a92f3b83802b38ca260187e9ffa53ea7dce32c8427a2ade9eeaa685f3","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00024","start":0,"end":300,"exact":"One of the key ways in which Islamophobia is institutionalized in India is through the trope of the “oppressed Muslim woman.” This Instagram post by “Hindurastra2” celebrates the interfaith relationship between a Muslim woman, who wears a hijab, and a Hindu man, who has a red tilak on his forehead. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:486df2da1a072663bca6a28947da42b6cf79aecf369c9e1aa72b56c1068b4a43","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00024","start":300,"end":343,"exact":"The image appears to have been manipulated."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:0ed3a59fcf5c1f604c03a6c245b438bb8f8f63597fa68cea59bf481f17a74175","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00025","start":0,"end":119,"exact":"The caption reads that the pair “will be together for seven lives” and that the woman will not be a victim of divorce. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:bc86a1bb3df6fcfb2277771bca8d26fc07862ccc25a95e67a6a5bbf65ef61ebd","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00025","start":119,"end":262,"exact":"In other words, she has been saved by being in a relationship with a Hindu man, as the Hindu religion is allegedly more progressive than Islam."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:544bc4f33ff82a6e6081fb72e53cc4a3048a57fcbc65fc7121ab36c9b6cdd3b2","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00026","start":0,"end":315,"exact":"At a time when the conversion of Hindus to other religions is actively discouraged (see this media item on India’s anti-conversion law and the conspiracy of “love jihad”), conversion to Hinduism is being subtly encouraged, as changing the religious demography of India is one of the key tenets of Hindutva ideology."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:404ba19efc1152c4f935f074043ca7a8d1a5561ae15f70260b26a2b786b38529","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00027","start":0,"end":205,"exact":"The narrative expressed in this item is: “Muslim women should be rescued from the oppressiveness of Islam.” This narrative has been in existence for decades but has gained ground since the BJP took power. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:bfe666b1d38b111d65fe8a62c1c6a1d3c0e9cec984d50c1aaddcb976fddb3a81","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00027","start":205,"end":337,"exact":"In 2019, for instance, the BJP outlawed a Muslim divorce practice called “Triple Talaq”, arguing that it “saves thousands of women.”"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:21d4c60f05ebaaa07df1ed427facb306cdac9b0ebbc6fa538a75d24d58af423a","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00028","start":0,"end":32,"exact":"More analysis of this item here."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:89401182c086e4d6ae26792c7679c659dd517e416113bccc9d121cb60e144a43","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00029","start":0,"end":58,"exact":"Want more context on India’s hyper-nationalist narratives?"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:0be47d1462b7dbc6ce9edd023fc5eb005aa0791ed19c13576613ed8772d6974c","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00030","start":0,"end":31,"exact":"See our deep dive on the issue."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:25dbb850c42c91fd8f293c52a797ef552d2cf4bb40fab63aad922f94f76246b3","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00031","start":0,"end":45,"exact":"DONATE to support the Civic Media Observatory"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:6483cb7c3249b5432db6a6609520db5d8a8f7d8f378985d4c87ff6482211ad5a","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00032","start":0,"end":156,"exact":"Undertones is the Civic Media Observatory's newsletter, created collaboratively by the Observatory's researchers, coordinating editors, and project writer. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:dfff938c7f4b70b943acf3a9ea875d73f0882c5bf1b1e0480455062be53ec612","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e","blockId":"gv-756551-b00032","start":156,"end":230,"exact":"Find out more about our mission, methodology, and publicly available data."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:fbd391c2886a6613a86f54ce17a88213","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"fbd391c2886a6613a86f54ce17a88213","outcome":"not_applicable","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-hostility:discrimination_claim:2026-03-operational-1:794fad83018ea1e0de86fe60ff7dec7a18160eddcba979e1750fdd782a8456f3","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:aca5b9320adfb82b697f08ef1e7a840e:u_f00916bf94db56f58af165ca","attribution":"unknown","speaker":"Unknown","speakerStance":"not_applicable","documentStance":"not_applicable","proposition":"","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","unitContext":["urn:doxa:passage:ba25b9cf69218435458390ad32c3b9c21009fff2258642e350aaaa0de4381daf","urn:doxa:passage:c5ed683835b7de9135f322cf97b3d4fbe6212b8d4f15cb1447c168f762ac5c2d","urn:doxa:passage:050508149354e809612a076372d16f52d803a473221b2854d3b08f2e379ce8a6","urn:doxa:passage:e6870e6e09904204b5d43826af198b1bcfe68c16ad57dfdead3bf7a37742283c","urn:doxa:passage:9c8a14990cd47d47272a37f2be4fc8b8c4cf48855baaf89f43d6ba4c63da6ac7","urn:doxa:passage:594cf22f7515b88c1a57a52a29521b6a55ad1037a05518ff6f5abaddf510e3a5","urn:doxa:passage:82b88871e200cf33d7fe30212478aed8715ff0fdcababd6fc8b51789a4234dc0","urn:doxa:passage:8eddff6a92f3b83802b38ca260187e9ffa53ea7dce32c8427a2ade9eeaa685f3","urn:doxa:passage:486df2da1a072663bca6a28947da42b6cf79aecf369c9e1aa72b56c1068b4a43","urn:doxa:passage:0ed3a59fcf5c1f604c03a6c245b438bb8f8f63597fa68cea59bf481f17a74175","urn:doxa:passage:bc86a1bb3df6fcfb227777