782a8456f3","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d:u_24246623667b54ed96cfb574","attribution":"reported_speaker","speaker":"Unspecified 'they' (referring to people mentioned in the context of blaming communal politics)","speakerStance":"opposes","documentStance":"neutral","proposition":"The party's anti-minority actions have altered India's secular fabric.","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","explanation":"The text reports claims that the party's actions are anti-minority and degrade India's secular fabric.","modelPassage":["urn:doxa:passage:10f60fc9f00edefb15100c209466a3981acaf6600af291f270ab6be5702b77c3"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:0953ac3ce9ac13cfdb9e6989dd886f9a1d816bebf176042809c413d7f96720db","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00017","start":0,"end":93,"exact":"Others accused Modi of being a Muslim and owing his allegiance to Muslims instead of Hindus. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:4a0ff5966aed18f9b25cb41f73ac30137d8d8d994ac489b9c26b19217c05e275","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00017","start":93,"end":200,"exact":"They claimed that Modi had shown his true avatar by shunning his Hindutva principles to side with Muslims. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:64aa9d743e22ffe737a9a6aeeb5f510d","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"64aa9d743e22ffe737a9a6aeeb5f510d","outcome":"does_not_meet","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-hostility:stereotyping_and_intent:2026-03-operational-1:07d629353e1806de5b8b1a9c1b3000a003614c74470cf23c5ebe4839ea602097","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d:u_24246623667b54ed96cfb574","attribution":"reported_speaker","speaker":"Twitter users","speakerStance":"unclear","documentStance":"neutral","proposition":"Modi is shunning Hindutva to side with Muslims","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","modelPassage":["urn:doxa:passage:0953ac3ce9ac13cfdb9e6989dd886f9a1d816bebf176042809c413d7f96720db","urn:doxa:passage:4a0ff5966aed18f9b25cb41f73ac30137d8d8d994ac489b9c26b19217c05e275"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:1cd4a98fa09c8dceafa42a0ca1160b55","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"1cd4a98fa09c8dceafa42a0ca1160b55","outcome":"does_not_meet","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-hostility:targeted_hostility:2026-03-operational-1:72f7ea3551be2ef7fd32d774ee261f75056cf16c773d8b5a2d7a194b6c879a2d","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d:u_24246623667b54ed96cfb574","attribution":"reported_speaker","speaker":"Twitter users","speakerStance":"unclear","documentStance":"neutral","proposition":"Modi owes allegiance to Muslims","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","modelPassage":["urn:doxa:passage:0953ac3ce9ac13cfdb9e6989dd886f9a1d816bebf176042809c413d7f96720db","urn:doxa:passage:4a0ff5966aed18f9b25cb41f73ac30137d8d8d994ac489b9c26b19217c05e275"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:1fd4ca5452aedd8c8eb6cfae7c38b9d2","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"1fd4ca5452aedd8c8eb6cfae7c38b9d2","outcome":"does_not_meet","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-racism:exclusion:2025-operational-1:58af664b53f3bbc982a55b72222757384bb7ee5f78fe0304068038feb47eafe4","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d:u_24246623667b54ed96cfb574","attribution":"reported_speaker","speaker":"Unspecified 'they'","speakerStance":"opposes","documentStance":"neutral","proposition":"The party's actions are anti-minority.","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","modelPassage":["urn:doxa:passage:10f60fc9f00edefb15100c209466a3981acaf6600af291f270ab6be5702b77c3"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:a9e8241445477e4b57d337587b4b0392ad63610b232d28041b990e1fa45229f0","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00026","start":0,"end":121,"exact":"It remains to be seen if the mainstream criticism of the BJP has emerged as a sustained trend or as a momentary reaction."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:f90145de5de35bd16e1301c86101a42f","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"f90145de5de35bd16e1301c86101a42f","outcome":"uncertain","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-racism:institutional_pattern:2025-operational-1:ecbb016b6baf762e73d31e3b32c63b7fc6774025c77f32ff9fd824284fb4ac7b","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d:u_24246623667b54ed96cfb574","attribution":"reported_speaker","speaker":"Various social media users and analysts","speakerStance":"unclear","documentStance":"neutral","proposition":"The BJP's communal politics and anti-minority actions have altered India's secular fabric and degraded its global image.","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","explanation":"The text reports individual social media accusations and mentions a shrinking space for dissent, but the author explicitly notes it is unclear if the criticism constitutes a sustained trend rather than a momentary reaction.","modelPassage":["urn:doxa:passage:a9e8241445477e4b57d337587b4b0392ad63610b232d28041b990e1fa45229f0"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:ec7dfe607f258276942533b78b5d23bf","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"ec7dfe607f258276942533b78b5d23bf","outcome":"does_not_meet","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-racism:racialization:2025-operational-1:22ba2440d280286f7582830210857fa8b3d81eaaa16f9803c2cd8ab087e9a643","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d:u_24246623667b54ed96cfb574","attribution":"reported_speaker","speaker":"Twitter user सत्य वचन (true words) and others","speakerStance":"opposes","documentStance":"neutral","proposition":"Modi is a Muslim or owes allegiance to Muslims instead of Hindus.","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","modelPassage":["urn:doxa:passage:0953ac3ce9ac13cfdb9e6989dd886f9a1d816bebf176042809c413d7f96720db","urn:doxa:passage:4a0ff5966aed18f9b25cb41f73ac30137d8d8d994ac489b9c26b19217c05e275"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:c085dd1ab0d2760c87d70f778a2190df21bb01a1ca80d4c62734cb2d4a2e1c45","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00012","start":0,"end":228,"exact":"Anti-Muslim violence has been escalating in India, with state-sponsored attacks on Muslims through strategic campaigns and the dissemination of misinformation and propaganda on social media platforms and primetime news channels."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:d714dbbfbdc2a73356c1aa6f6eb779327919a912b6ebb26aeb028789fb90b7fc","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00015","start":154,"end":432,"exact":"Indians took no time to realise that the decision had come, not out of a sudden sense of guilt or regret over the remarks, since BJP members have historically always indulged in anti-Muslim hate-speech, but solely in response to external pressure from Middle Eastern countries. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:cb0207d02cd075323cd35e818c3c557a","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"cb0207d02cd075323cd35e818c3c557a","outcome":"meets_criterion","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-hostility:discrimination_claim:2026-03-operational-1:794fad83018ea1e0de86fe60ff7dec7a18160eddcba979e1750fdd782a8456f3","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d:u_f4fcd1a47a7fbc8fb935dcb3","attribution":"reported_speaker","speaker":"The document/unspecified sources","speakerStance":"unclear","documentStance":"neutral","proposition":"Muslims face state-sponsored attacks and strategic campaigns of misinformation.","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","explanation":"The text reports claims of state-sponsored attacks and historical indulgence in anti-Muslim hate speech by party members.","modelPassage":["urn:doxa:passage:c085dd1ab0d2760c87d70f778a2190df21bb01a1ca80d4c62734cb2d4a2e1c45","urn:doxa:passage:d714dbbfbdc2a73356c1aa6f6eb779327919a912b6ebb26aeb028789fb90b7fc"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:16307743dfbbb0ee64e04626d6fbc74e","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"16307743dfbbb0ee64e04626d6fbc74e","outcome":"does_not_meet","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-hostility:stereotyping_and_intent:2026-03-operational-1:07d629353e1806de5b8b1a9c1b3000a003614c74470cf23c5ebe4839ea602097","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d:u_f4fcd1a47a7fbc8fb935dcb3","attribution":"author","speaker":"Ananya","speakerStance":"neutral","documentStance":"neutral","proposition":"N/A","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","modelPassage":["urn:doxa:passage:d714dbbfbdc2a73356c1aa6f6eb779327919a912b6ebb26aeb028789fb90b7fc"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:751ddd1451e71c20adc1f3ce65994997","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"751ddd1451e71c20adc1f3ce65994997","outcome":"does_not_meet","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-hostility:targeted_hostility:2026-03-operational-1:72f7ea3551be2ef7fd32d774ee261f75056cf16c773d8b5a2d7a194b6c879a2d","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d:u_f4fcd1a47a7fbc8fb935dcb3","attribution":"author","speaker":"Ananya","speakerStance":"neutral","documentStance":"neutral","proposition":"N/A","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","modelPassage":["urn:doxa:passage:d714dbbfbdc2a73356c1aa6f6eb779327919a912b6ebb26aeb028789fb90b7fc"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:e240c6502e89f1ac8ff78f6c32bdd1f2d02cba467175d60d1a9de2bff588535d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00001","start":0,"end":95,"exact":"This story is part of a Civic Media Observatory investigation into the Indian media ecosystem. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:e27bade644c32c142b47d351447debbca119b66b85d44493e75c4fc1bf4088cb","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00001","start":95,"end":156,"exact":"To learn more about this project and its methods, click here."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:0134210b778d7876009eb03ca879b60730c08db3ae2a3e5e03d09a5acbe9f4a4","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00002","start":0,"end":248,"exact":"On June 5, 2022, the ruling Bharatiya Janata Party (BJP) in India suspended its spokesperson Nupur Sharma and expelled its Delhi media head Naveen Kumar Jindal over their remarks on the Prophet Muhammad that have made headlines in India and abroad."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:afcf186267c4c037b1d799e60446add4dea6f75866a5ff32aece9b8e6ca236af","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00003","start":0,"end":207,"exact":"On the night of May 26, Sharma allegedly made derogatory remarks against the Prophet Muhammad during a show about the Gyanvapi mosque–Kashi Vishwanath temple dispute on Times Now, a private TV news channel. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:17bc55a91e37d16f6df414de5da922661cf8d45a7cd17411dc27de747baf7b2d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00003","start":207,"end":549,"exact":"On May 28, Raza Academy, an organization of Indian Sunni Muslims, filed a First Information Report (FIR) against Sharma under Sections 295A (acts intended to provoke religious feelings), 153A (inciting enmity between different groups) and 505B (pursuading to commit an offence against the State or disturbing peace) of the Indian Penal Code. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:b150d0fba358564fddf3017484476cdde0154f02eb3ba3f0a788042c1a4ff335","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00003","start":549,"end":583,"exact":"A second FIR was lodged on May 30."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:68e26a09a93c8205e0b6e2f96c6430270beeb861eaca81d77cda2eaaa9608c64","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00004","start":0,"end":94,"exact":"There was widespread condemnation of Sharma’s remarks in India, while many also defended her. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:89d4da622b0a2f1211524358134181786eb1420b22c720a3ee89aad72aac0411","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00004","start":94,"end":128,"exact":"Expat Indian Shafi Burfat tweeted:"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:26ee95fc65eed39da0dd496fa246a6ec552ffb9ed29ac4a3671d4702aee136ed","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00005","start":0,"end":50,"exact":"Rightwing Twitter user @AryanKaushik149 mentioned:"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:dd3c1e1fac4f75c39c2a69d6962b7521f9ca88d1dcc78982e411325abfc69c01","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00006","start":0,"end":138,"exact":"On June 3, violence erupted in the city of Kanpur in the northern state of Uttar Pradesh after some groups protested against her remarks. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:034976eb7f9e8753513d43ae4eb17804bd866b6f40489ef43c2e0d19d1e87038","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00006","start":138,"end":240,"exact":"Dozens of people were injured and the police charged over 800 people in connection with the violence. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:c9376bc6a70320c692065a17e149c26dda3c03aea152fff4e288a352ac918869","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00006","start":240,"end":405,"exact":"India soon found itself in a diplomatic row with a number of Muslim majority countries in the Middle East, who condemned the derogatory remarks on Prophet Muhammad. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:750cc04e8f1aa81dba96058dd1a1fbf00658b25673d71df70d33eb791f438590","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00006","start":405,"end":467,"exact":"There are over 6.5 million Indian migrants in the Middle East."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:2237dde37213ed64397c6442ff07a8a16cc5e51f8d059b75aff2143f1a3e85be","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00007","start":0,"end":74,"exact":"The official Twitter account of the Saudi Arabian Foreign Ministry stated:"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:b8c826d59a4b8c605cb73048cd155c23270b741d2d1eaff157e230a66a66d647","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00008","start":0,"end":153,"exact":"Qatar, Kuwait and several other Muslim nations summoned the Indian ambassadors in their respective countries and lodged official protests against India. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:d0db40a7b9c29c34adbd16013125ec4261925ad2b3b950f1b6f83e4580ec08ba","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00008","start":153,"end":280,"exact":"The hashtag #BoycottIndianProducts was trending on Twitter, and a Kuwaiti supermarket pulled Indian products off their shelves."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:f9d09f8e8ca4af1b22487e2380a4079d66c2d0d923e427329a18e838ccb43c5a","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00009","start":0,"end":38,"exact":"The Indian Embassy in Qatar responded:"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:8770c23fa22aaae171221f654ead113ad084c2163a68e2e0c1694401055e23fa","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00010","start":0,"end":139,"exact":"The Indian government’s response that these were not the views of the Government of India, but of fringe elements, created further debate. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:e8880094f7b1d80ab4840b7e628236dfdee39d58c269793e38bae0e16a231338","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00010","start":139,"end":290,"exact":"Many BJP supporters were outraged by the decision to remove Sharma and Jindal and showed their support for the two, while others backed the BJP’s move."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:279c4cfebed85cf2de934b752a21f5a1d084f486c1bc582d7b36de8b5559171f","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00011","start":0,"end":251,"exact":"The Organisation of Islamic Cooperation (OIC) condemned Sharma's remarks, saying that they came “​​in the context of the escalation of hatred and abuse of Islam in India,” which an Indian Foreign Ministry spokesperson rejected calling ”narrow-minded”."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:ff8d051ef223749bc78022f7e3e774155cd6f7ffca01184cb94b127ada3389d0","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00013","start":0,"end":103,"exact":"Read More: Decoding the role of mainstream and social media in the recent anti-Muslim violence in India"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:1c52b2d4a1f33b62696692c211c01d6e95d4b4a5cfb3892f687c3a6f16786523","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00014","start":0,"end":61,"exact":"“BJP has failed Hindus” CMO data reveals a trending narrative"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:187a4cff982e52d94660b7e59da966e9d26b4c609fe35c0b2492b23cff7b0d4d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00015","start":0,"end":154,"exact":"#ShameOnBJP, #ModiShamesIndia, and #ShameOnBJPGOVT were the hashtags trending on Twitter following the BJP action towards Nupur Sharma and Naveen Jindal. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:2e2645cdad182af0a13acd82c28b9bda5f75049faad211631cfb3715bbfebae6","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00015","start":432,"end":573,"exact":"To BJP supporters it meant that the Hindu nationalist party had accepted defeat in the face of threat and condemnation from Islamic nations. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:e876109ab0e8db9d325d6f1746fae1b47704f1aa08d02954e8355d85b35ecdfd","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00015","start":573,"end":783,"exact":"For a prime minister who had built his media image as that of a hypermasculine Hindu leader, the act of bowing down in front of Islamic nations was seen as an insult, a symbol of Hindus bowing down to Muslims. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:58a50744eb9e44cc2f7b86a4973f5d991a9d7b0522b3e322caba8e6615cd5b8c","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00015","start":783,"end":930,"exact":"The BJP propaganda machine had convinced Indians that Narendra Modi had single-handedly increased India’s power and prestige in the global sphere. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:b826190622d6e79f74c90178caa481d222f0501f4cedeaabb8b53a47784a4fd8","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d","blockId":"gv-764743-b00015","start":930,"end":994,"exact":"Indians believed that Modi’s India was invincible and powerful. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:af093ebec5d099477fec4664e50eeadd","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"af093ebec5d099477fec4664e50eeadd","outcome":"does_not_meet","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-racism:exclusion:2025-operational-1:58af664b53f3bbc982a55b72222757384bb7ee5f78fe0304068038feb47eafe4","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:5ffd5e063cbb6c89a7dd065959375e2d:u_f4fcd1a47a7fbc8fb935dcb3","attribution":"unknown","speaker":"Unknown","speakerStance":"not_applicable","documentStance":"not_applicable","proposition":"","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","unitContext":["urn:doxa:passage:e240c6502e89f1ac8ff78f6c32bdd1f2d02cba467175d60d1a9de2bff588535d","urn:doxa:passage:e27bade644c32c142b47d351447debbca119b66b85d44493e75c4fc1bf4088cb","urn:doxa:passage:0134210b778d7876009eb03ca879b60730c08db3ae2a3e5e03d09a5acbe9f4a4","urn:doxa:passage:afcf186267c4c037b1d799e60446add4dea6f75866a5ff32aece9b8e6ca236af","urn:doxa:passage:17bc55a91e37d16f6df414de5da922661cf8d45a7cd17411dc27de747baf7b2d","urn:doxa:passage:b150d0fba358564fddf3017484476cdde0154f02eb3ba3f0a788042c1a4ff335","urn:doxa:passage:68e26a09a93c8205e0b6e2f96c6430270beeb861eaca81d77cda2eaaa9608c64","urn:doxa:passage:89d4da622b0a2f1211524358134181786eb1420b22c720a3ee89aad72aac0411","urn:doxa:passage:26ee95fc65eed39da0dd496fa246a6ec552ffb9ed29ac4a3671d4702aee136ed","urn:doxa:passage:dd3c1e1fac4f75c39c2a69d6962b7521f9ca88d1dcc78982e411325abfc69c01","urn:doxa:passage:034976eb7f9e8753513d43ae4eb17804bd866b6f40489ef43c2e0d19d1e87038","urn:doxa:passage:c9376bc6a70320c692065a17e149c26dda3c03aea152fff4e288a3