contentSha256":"55612758d303ea8b8dfd0ad8ea1b0bc45460d1d2e11d3aa1de2d0571b39bd98c","textSha256":"3c0e504317239e4606e16cedb160edcaf552b020a30e3bfbaff4ed942830bff1","archivedRecordSha256":"8c6c125d6b79270cf585f557a7bc842acf82cf0b2aa04df8129102cbb427d93a","inStudy":"urn:doxa:study:muslim-coverage-1"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:unit:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5:u_11819da469c7ea5bdb5c2497","@type":["doxa:SourceUnit","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"u_11819da469c7ea5bdb5c2497","status":"accepted","fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:unit:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5:u_373d1d8dcd68daee3388c6fc","@type":["doxa:SourceUnit","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"u_373d1d8dcd68daee3388c6fc","status":"accepted","fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:unit:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5:u_ab7e480efb4c544a0aff91e5","@type":["doxa:SourceUnit","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"u_ab7e480efb4c544a0aff91e5","status":"accepted","fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:729027dec865c30aac31ad01bb10199df29cd5116d37203ab8132a0d794f55ed","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5","blockId":"gv-790498-b00040","start":0,"end":163,"exact":"An example of how this narrative spreads online: “I condemn the HDP members who did not stand up during the national anthem in the Turkish Grand National Assembly”"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:5ca7e58292c88de403ea93bb25d64d326f5fe21567a984dd06030d0cf1be54af","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5","blockId":"gv-790498-b00041","start":0,"end":27,"exact":"Where it is shared: Twitter"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:bcba03ead02a277b7abf2da7d530de02d74e924e2576a83ef7a5410f4f1386f1","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5","blockId":"gv-790498-b00042","start":0,"end":121,"exact":"Author: Mücahit Birinci, a member of the highest official executive body after party leadership (Central Executive Board)"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:287dd144eaf602b75db8c0c95638ae9b2a62374eaedc3c824bf7863096c455b0","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5","blockId":"gv-790498-b00043","start":0,"end":167,"exact":"Content: Mücahit Birinci claimed that HDP parliamentarians did not stand up for the national anthem during the opening ceremony of the new parliament on June 2, 2023. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:3d4391acaabc9541db0aaab14c795aa9838cf8f4d1b368eaa145382903746aef","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5","blockId":"gv-790498-b00043","start":167,"end":302,"exact":"He also criticized the CHP's collaboration with HDP, which he calls the political wing of the Kurdish armed guerilla movement, the PKK."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:760d3bd88d4f29541c8d3b531f11719a69fd4852f79273f6adcd9b0af6165ad6","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5","blockId":"gv-790498-b00044","start":0,"end":119,"exact":"Context: There is a recording of the event showing every member of the parliament standing up for the national anthem. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:1c0b146e901f0519d44a4d0eb337912b9148738353a7f064d8efe56520a4f2df","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5","blockId":"gv-790498-b00044","start":119,"end":264,"exact":"It is hard to call this comment unintentional misinformation since Birinci, as a high-ranking AKP official, was certainly watching the ceremony. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:3838f2f6c9b8f9038d825bb0802c932c56e126c00264038cf189d5dda3e341eb","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5","blockId":"gv-790498-b00044","start":264,"end":409,"exact":"Pro-state media also fanned the flames by claiming that HDP members did not sing the anthem, which is not a requirement per parliamentary rules. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:9ed8e2f4cf1cd6ded2feb98caddfda71f25173d08ed022bb2366caa59a00de30","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5","blockId":"gv-790498-b00044","start":409,"end":506,"exact":"The timing of these two provocations suggests that this was an organized communications strategy."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:a9b68e2ac14181efc1c4fae6569943c3cd2b0e621bdb361a9699fca1c31bffe9","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5","blockId":"gv-790498-b00045","start":0,"end":152,"exact":"Subtext: Birinci implies that HDP members have a problem with the foundations of the Turkish state because they are collaborating with terrorist groups."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:afdf34705fb1d1631d3d4363393a6db6d6b8e33b5170a3e91e4f3011285c5c1a","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5","blockId":"gv-790498-b00046","start":0,"end":121,"exact":"Civic Impact: -3, the lowest score on our scorecard, as it is an open lie to criminalize and delegitimize the opposition."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:4f89dccd70059cdc9598d77d0ac5fe15010f1c7eda44354450391a176a461a9d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5","blockId":"gv-790498-b00047","start":0,"end":42,"exact":"See more related items here: 492, 493, 517"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:d350daba40a5e905b9dc315258078de3064f8b343aa9a27ac860dd402e8efb39","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac3177d1c06ffb85a40e41125eb2c5","blockId":"gv-790498-b00048","start":0,"end":31,"exact":"See this story's public dataset"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:e86a4425493a5715ddd9cd1e838d84e93b821b8f12f066d4d7bc63ad2d853169","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:6dac317