m to open a new entrance."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:a4366884a5666f6eb47b9b37d298327c5bba69c0da94eb832778ac0b08489895","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00018","start":0,"end":136,"exact":"In May 2010, based on the 1970s law, the General Custodian transferred the ownership of the Ghaith-Sub Laban property to Atara Leyoshna."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:39f36e4de0603a1759426b2bd9e3fd80479a60eac4f4de4b964d6584bca96b95","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00019","start":0,"end":96,"exact":"Shortly after gaining ownership, Atara Leyoshna initiated an eviction claim against the family. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:9a1ff200a86005828d40ea662e37cb6ce9366c208122a944d0f576177bdedd39","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00019","start":96,"end":140,"exact":"The case reached the Supreme Court in 2016. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:d37a593fa1d01f0ffda8431eab7b5c895187b72ec84370b4f9aede18873ca571","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00019","start":140,"end":327,"exact":"The court ruled to evict Nora and Mustafa's children but granted the couple, as protected tenants, the right to remain in their home for an additional 10 years, breaking the family apart."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:f0adae38285b11cd3ace4e82110628d40e969bbcbba72e99cab8e274b339244b","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00020","start":0,"end":177,"exact":"In 2018, Israeli settlers launched another eviction lawsuit, claiming that Nora and Mustafa had violated the terms of their “protected tenancy” by spending time away from home. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:a07d4d07d5107909ee2b4f16875439fbeb03f1534c9903c71081831d5d3d1b0d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00020","start":177,"end":334,"exact":"Nora needed medical assistance and temporarily stayed at Raafat's residence in Shofat camp, where he had moved with his younger sister after their eviction. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:3897aa43c6008b9a4195bc5b1a5639c0cca4701f2d350f5dc3638cc9cf051b7d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00020","start":334,"end":462,"exact":"This arrangement was necessary, as per Raafat’s account, the children were prohibited from staying overnight with their parents."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:f0b4522dd27505c4454c44c4cef49652a5f5175fc5a91bf5e9cd1da53304c793","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00021","start":0,"end":56,"exact":"> In early 2018, my mother went on an Umrah pilgrimage. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:13a169022c6770ab96747f4cc8fc909467178623ed7a8c8197e75e81ca38dd2d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00021","start":56,"end":153,"exact":"She already had issues with discs in her lower back and neck, which worsened during the journey. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:2469698f17aa8fa401fff9b9f8c93b71a4aba1bb348c92c1123d4ac081f0ace0","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00021","start":153,"end":217,"exact":"As she required assistance while recovering, she stayed with me."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:f1e98fef6c5a3c26827d5d6476f61050ac8a17f28411f617ded086f393f00e2d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00022","start":0,"end":107,"exact":"> The settlers closely monitored my parents’ movement using cameras, and they noticed my mother's absence. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:18c362cfc82792cc7e78bd0e60f4e9b69a426a17ce4c2b605ab31e9840a399f3","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00022","start":107,"end":188,"exact":"However, my father traveled between their home and my residence during that time."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:7cd60f357567e74ace8b3aad4e84a102c5f032ba253edead7110bbd41dfbe358","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00023","start":0,"end":120,"exact":"The settlers exploited Nora’s absence during her recovery to argue that she had forfeited her protected tenancy status. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:9908f7bb369e645f156b5ccfb43e00252477013c268edb02fda5c2a4c7260da1","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00023","start":120,"end":264,"exact":"Despite having medical records from Israeli health service providers as evidence, the lower court unjustly ruled in favor of the settler group. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:bf5edcd5dc4ca612323e67aa55455753ca2a10636367e0de6dcb638d650c9032","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00023","start":264,"end":359,"exact":"The family's request to appeal against the decision was recently rejected by the Supreme Court."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:8d1d357673ec6a78713b634aa9440036791707925c997ced384120c0eeebdbeb","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00024","start":0,"end":39,"exact":"Unexpected allies fight with the family"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:aaf852d3439fbd4313edc0f3aefc908baf8fbb3a1e88d74a98d6b247ee530e84","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00025","start":0,"end":92,"exact":"Nora and Mustafa are facing imminent eviction, scheduled between June 28 and July 23, 2023. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:8061c1bc3fd9e627be1e2c0762392ed365cbaeb9320fbd75625b7d422151c445","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00025","start":92,"end":264,"exact":"Exhausting all legal avenues, their only hope now lies in government intervention, which can be influenced by public pressure and advocacy efforts, as per Raafat’s account."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:0bb38ab0c5f7bb216a98913083dd0fc8dc36b84e97cb981108b97bc8189bf219","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00026","start":0,"end":178,"exact":"Free Jerusalem, a collective of radical Israeli activists based in West Jerusalem, is dedicated to resisting Israeli apartheid and supporting Palestinians in occupied Jerusalem. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:1a512380f6a7be2835a48ab1ee3241d48708e22b34ea464e6058c9a7597fae35","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00026","start":178,"end":361,"exact":"Their mission encompasses fighting against family displacements, home demolitions, police brutality, settler violence, among other unjust practices and policies carried out by Israel."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:a955333b71763f6bd379776bfe757f644bed3eaafde6213d8358a04a94163031","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00027","start":0,"end":73,"exact":"The movement has been supporting the Ghaith Sub Laban family since 2015. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:0d31edfab4681b9955e411cf068757d473997b8f2743744df895711aed1d4bd2","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00027","start":73,"end":233,"exact":"They have been providing round-the-clock support to the family at their home to garner attention and solidarity from both Israeli and international communities."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:d4aba9e63743b26ea27dfce1fed2334acc40962d7c041a2a143b39eb6bd33392","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00028","start":0,"end":272,"exact":"In a WhatsApp conversation with Global Voices, Gal Kramarski, a spokesperson for the movement, exposed Israel's complex and influential mechanism designed to displace Palestinians and expel them from Jerusalem, creating opportunities for Zionist settlers to replace them. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:3a46084b3c0119a9de146eeea4a34d0153919d789fe4f2b21e19d6115e7b1de8","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00028","start":272,"end":412,"exact":"She highlighted the manipulation of discriminatory laws through a pseudo-legal process to forcefully evict families and leave them homeless."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:41cc8f41618f5f2bdf715dab02972c2a75675094fba78db00d5776a391dfc1e5","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00029","start":0,"end":79,"exact":"> Hundreds of families face this threat and live in constant fear and anxiety. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:e0de2b550c2842f6757d3e913be83fe4f1a25f2b935d924f07d0b2dce87fa64c","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00029","start":79,"end":252,"exact":"This alarming reality, which we also see in Sheikh Jarrah, Silwan, and other Palestinian neighborhoods in Jerusalem, is what the Ghaith-Sub Laban family is currently facing."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:b4aa7429530a997afc7fc5c6cf1142d8b3d1744739fb05344ead3fb0e66dbfbb","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c","blockId":"gv-791069-b00030","start":0,"end":124,"exact":"> We emphasize that this is not merely a property dispute, as Israel claims, it is ethnic cleansing, and it must be stopped."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:9416690b9c7f5b37035ddaac0fe46a6b","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"9416690b9c7f5b37035ddaac0fe46a6b","outcome":"does_not_meet","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-hostility:discrimination_claim:2026-03-operational-1:794fad83018ea1e0de86fe60ff7dec7a18160eddcba979e1750fdd782a8456f3","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:cb82a7b6cd0bcdb2c79e885d5c83009c:u_584d7fe77c543c28e47b78e6","attribution":"unknown","speaker":"Unknown","speakerStance":"not_applicable","documentStance":"not_applicable","proposition":"","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewed","unitContext":["urn:doxa:passage:66509d5bfb8b2673eebbaa4de7c0dc38b61b6044d933609f8b96145791f225ef","urn:doxa:passage:c673abf6fff1e8607a42c499089fe6b642e36613f0ec90084ec85aea0b38cee7","urn:doxa:passage:9289637e4f87b2355c20665bddff72b5c3a0d2e62694dc8eaf701202c63ec8d6","urn:doxa:passage:b7afb073c541d20e86d67e56edab6003eff0092836cf69b616bc6b695643ad6a","urn:doxa:passage:a4366884a5666f6eb47b9b37d298327c5bba69c0da94eb832778ac0b08489895","urn:doxa:passage:39f36e4de0603a1759426b2bd9e3fd80479a60eac4f4de4b964d6584bca96b95","urn:doxa:passage:9a1ff200a86005828d40ea662e37cb6ce9366c208122a944d0f576177bdedd39","urn:doxa:passage:d37a593fa1d01f0ffda8431eab7b5c895187b72ec84370b4f9aede18873ca571","urn:doxa:passage:f0adae38285b11cd3ace4e82110628d40e969bbcbba72e99cab8e274b339244b","urn:doxa:passage:a07d4d07d5107909ee2b4f16875439fbeb03f1534c9903c71081831d5d3d1b0d","urn:doxa:passage:3897aa43c6008b9a4195bc5b1a5639c0cca4701f2d350f5dc3638cc9cf051b7d","urn:doxa:passage:f0b4522dd27505c4454c44c4cef49652a5f5175fc5a91bf5e9cd1da53304c793","urn:doxa: