068cc","urn:doxa:passage:83ba058d6491a6b47d53479c3ebdb9f816d01d4a39d0a31bf01e38cc3775a2d5","urn:doxa:passage:dc0bf5e802849c17ca57fb8dc0022fe16245f14f4dbaf5db66eb4804dbd48208","urn:doxa:passage:33a39d01873c2ff00ebb566336595aea39dbf68b5068d0d0594d7ff08eb957f1","urn:doxa:passage:4274312d8499a3d208e996b13e66cbb3f01fe7d23a0e51b449f349f0555fa26c","urn:doxa:passage:17b3f311666a9d4e199ab50ecb553c115f8cfce195d7f478390667df2a1c8453","urn:doxa:passage:5ebc3541469adc945067109cdeb62640cdd5d3831637025f5410685095bedbbd","urn:doxa:passage:9d01ada8e2ce07368cddad5bcc4def61cdeb6675b45a7cd28493c34594561e68","urn:doxa:passage:5e234240a73fa712115e59bd6623ec289ee887303212d82139b01568816779c6","urn:doxa:passage:cf4837328d3c0376ff364ef9ff986a4418fd46b049110cb775a8da80935d64eb","urn:doxa:passage:fc2e802c5167e44d693b2b8a1926eff6cd1d5c423340ed51b836ed53e1e899b8","urn:doxa:passage:e9feb059b303d730fb0f1dbca1f5ff7c28fd9554153007bbdd310e9d98faf68a","urn:doxa:passage:237ad8e9427e1eb8b69bea5921154d6be69fdbc77e1ae8ad04c422efd32efd94","urn:doxa:passage:35e8c99ca8accf3d7d60a92a986362a04d6ef8426d5cd1a5c6e88e19da6270f5","urn:doxa:passage:0f87114542383082c2a72bf6585180fc0758c83556a454ecbea554e44465067b","urn:doxa:passage:06b2f19f0ea4717b39874129787aa347e7dbe97e29f6b70d372d4fabd23a25b3","urn:doxa:passage:aaf01be91e8fa48c32c0d4ffb619c28a7ec963f3899bbe197455ae76b2146479","urn:doxa:passage:1c4a0ef04ae002ea81470fa08f1b42a48513d778b55196b09be12aad3ba88cf1"]},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:2924c8d412be16f506d9bbf548ef3ccf42c796ee33cd37357443b333fd11f136","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00012","start":289,"end":475,"exact":"As a result, they advised against bathing in the Triveni Sangam — the holy confluence of the Ganges, Yamuna, and mythical Saraswati rivers located in Uttar Pradesh — due to health risks."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:33213b50f9401512d4fc2014b9477201d2134221d1cc20cb99614528742837e5","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00013","start":0,"end":168,"exact":"During the Maha Kumbh Mela celebrations, Delhi was also in the midst of the 2025 Delhi Legislative Assembly election campaign, which the BJP would later manage to win. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:cba001bb2d15e6dc7f5e4cfa2f31157915e5252e13b70b308850c7347b58dc48","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00013","start":168,"end":270,"exact":"The political debate intensified during the campaign, partly due to comments made by Yogi Adityanath. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:03d8b700a27f68af7c705fb17377efd53cda02034022ee16a596a0ff66c02c7e","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00013","start":270,"end":473,"exact":"At a BJP rally in Delhi, Adityanath accused the AAP and its ministers of allowing illegal settlements of Bangladeshis and Rohingyas — migrant minorities criminalized by both parties during the election. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:8cf6c028251ac147486c29977de1e2fb5862a0b45b5e6fadfedcb020ea3cd681","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00013","start":473,"end":704,"exact":"He claimed that AAP had turned the Yamuna River into a “polluted drain,” which he described as a “sin.” Then he challenged AAP leader Kejriwal to bathe in the Yamuna, as he had done at the Triveni Sangam during the Maha Kumbh Mela."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:da22705cf45a44e56d316d3d3af9bc907e1a39f08336e7532f73366863e81822","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00014","start":0,"end":48,"exact":"How this narrative is asserted online by the BJP"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:b5b313d82409257f0365cd5fcfff0d577a693e551d239a28465bc3425d3913ff","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00015","start":0,"end":309,"exact":"This X post by the official account of the ruling BJP party on World Water Day 2025 shows an animated Prime Minister Modi rising from the Ganges River in a prayerful stance, asserting that the government has allocated INR 401.2 trillion (approximately USD 4.7 billion) to the Namami Gange restoration project."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:60a6621823b8316b5a1fc81cd02ccdc56dbaa55e8154a8bbe0bb09ae72902fdd","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00016","start":0,"end":274,"exact":"In Hinduism, bathing in the sacred Ganges River is regarded as highly holy and spiritually significant, which is why the animated Prime Minister Modi rising from the Ganges River indirectly links the Namami Gange Programme with the preservation of Hindu religious practices."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:2487f77db95dda38585cf63e701e2a8be8038130236de96b08aa984497142310","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00017","start":0,"end":149,"exact":"A report published in late February 2025 found that funds allocated to the programme were underutilized during most of the years since its inception."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:68691bb8120cef7ff9fa0b72c47d6f7b9b084a912b036db58eb99a67372a6074","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00018","start":0,"end":91,"exact":"The item received 153 comments, 872 reposts, 2.5k likes, 16 bookmarks, and 21 quote posts. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:71d17aff95f70376ab7cebcbdcb12d2db1077cc08f5c3be40392c1b4e5fa2c23","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00018","start":91,"end":285,"exact":"It ranked -1 under our civic impact score, as it fails to acknowledge the ongoing critical condition of the Ganges's water quality while advertising the project as a success, misleading readers."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:a6300236136caa0f0985c1397f3bbd844d04bde4c6e7d2c5582f6f99942b6e1d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00019","start":0,"end":39,"exact":"See the full analysis of the item here."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:9a5f3b75f033c87ae9aea7da5cca57aeb64de934f657952edbd3d92c8f89daac","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00020","start":0,"end":60,"exact":"How this narrative is shared online by supporters of the BJP"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:8b1517be16a426195121901f0057f1432aa613651c9451b260b9d540923a1bde","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00021","start":0,"end":151,"exact":"In this post, the author celebrates the cleaning of Delhi's Yamuna River, led by the BJP, and shares a video showing a river skimming barge in action. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:0eb8e66f479d3bfa85f359a4166595906118b02526c4e9418923bf3633bf4050","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00021","start":151,"end":220,"exact":"He praises the BJP's swift efforts to fulfill its electoral promises."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:87c901ea2c05d74d891f3086666a36dda5980eb3d7626b1f2387a7d6f5770d29","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00022","start":0,"end":69,"exact":"The 2025 Delhi Legislative Assembly election was held on February 5. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:226f9c51397de17b2233a8c6ee59d1a8850f41f6417c63caca9b43523e9a29a7","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00022","start":69,"end":350,"exact":"The video attached to this item was initially shared by members of the Bharatiya Janata Party (BJP), including former Member of Parliament Ramesh Bidhuri and Delhi Lieutenant Governor VK Saxena, in mid-February, describing the initiative as the start of a massive cleaning effort. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:de8eda9e60876643b21822e47aebda6f5df863b1189396716f52cd4033f98b78","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00022","start":350,"end":511,"exact":"By the time the video was published, Atishi Marlena, from the Aam Aadmi Party (AAP), was the caretaker Chief Minister while the new government was being formed. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:92d4e9c61425a618f826ebbc23cbb0993d4a6376b75f30502d80ec0c16063e55","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00022","start":511,"end":637,"exact":"For the author of the tweet, this showcases the BJP's efficiency, as it started the work even before officially taking office."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:dc00ae14754d02bd7794a439a9bbe4c302195cf0732fc202e53762aff6288077","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00023","start":0,"end":136,"exact":"The tone of the author suggests that other governments from opposing parties have also failed to deliver in terms of cleaning the river."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:0dc0912f933d3387061ede92117df432a1a1b0573ab5a1b844b56e65ed6dee3d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00024","start":0,"end":94,"exact":"The item received 198 comments, 1.6K retweets, 8.2K likes, 65 bookmarks, and over 168K views. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:854cbf23bfa2d00af8396f64474a7c2f342e51f52e769503187874b9d3627400","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00024","start":94,"end":355,"exact":"It ranked -1 under our civic impact score, as it replicates the BJP's polarizing discourse without contextualizing the status of the Delhi government at the time of the video and fails to clarify which authority is behind the initiative, misleading its readers."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:f69cd3438226b982777d84722a5d5d36dc931d947a88858e257f401bc4e15ac0","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00025","start":0,"end":39,"exact":"See the full analysis of the item here."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:76eec4e23ce66b9337fdc135f4252e53f2490401ea54bc7e96284679182e73d0","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00026","start":0,"end":68,"exact":"Read more: The state of Data Governance in India and other countries"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:b825886d46a348e0a258ade0e584c932df9a175eb9c2459fa47b60864eedd353","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3","blockId":"gv-833294-b00027","start":0,"end":79,"exact":"Read more: The Garo tribe are stewards of the forest in India's Meghalaya hills"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:536cf17b6c6dd08ea200164e5a1dc282","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"536cf17b6c6dd08ea200164e5a1dc282","outcome":"does_not_meet","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-hostility:discrimination_claim:2026-03-operational-1:794fad83018ea1e0de86fe60ff7dec7a18160eddcba979e1750fdd782a8456f3","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:7027d116ba64f8e5af0a1196e809a6f3:u_afa7cab14005ac5e1a4f487d","attribution":"unknown","speaker":"Unknown","speakerStance":"not_applicable","documentStance":"not_applica