s For Liberty argued that officials should not engage in a malicious witch hunt on the basis of religious ideology."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:9ce1991a40ba4b854d7529ce400242d8531a2f99323651a9d54f8eddaea3e1bb","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:c24ddd71cfef4babf4e96e1a768d5e1d","blockId":"gv-836133-b00021","start":0,"end":164,"exact":"> …the fact that Islam is the official religion does not authorise the government to go on a witch-hunt against events which allegedly infringe the tenets of Islam."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:cde0c2087cdd6003e4c7a798396bfa6b66e75aeecb373903fa560b9c34eb33bf","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:c24ddd71cfef4babf4e96e1a768d5e1d","blockId":"gv-836133-b00022","start":0,"end":99,"exact":"> In any event, in no way does this public health event for a minority group offend against Islam. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:94ec0d791a441a5ba0e306861eaf3ecc166238a1409823380d40f9eb09614cbd","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:c24ddd71cfef4babf4e96e1a768d5e1d","blockId":"gv-836133-b00022","start":99,"end":159,"exact":"Islam encourages compassion and aid to those who require it."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:5bd6ab8c61094ab757858e319a5cb5ce0a5614bf1b8757ddb1b984e3c5b47d69","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:c24ddd71cfef4babf4e96e1a768d5e1d","blockId":"gv-836133-b00023","start":0,"end":153,"exact":"> The government must also ensure that Ministers do not irresponsibly make statements that have no legal basis and incite hatred towards minority groups."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:32bd49858ca3c07706a6ceb049de5e1f","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"32bd49858ca3c07706a6ceb049de5e1f","outcome":"does_not_meet","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-hostility:discrimination_claim:2026-03-operational-1:794fad83018ea1e0de86fe60ff7dec7a18160eddcba979e1750fdd7