tart":0,"end":119,"exact":"Gender-based violence, including marital rape, occurs worldwide, and often, the perpetrators are the victim's husband. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:1a3a13cdfcccc5ad49071e83d7f384caeb576be9b574957df3f06d73bb699103","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00002","start":119,"end":224,"exact":"Marital rape is defined as an act in which one partner forces the other to engage in non-consensual sex. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:6a784b8607969e93dae1a02aacde208efeca4908c1579dcdcdd2a73b4bac83aa","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00002","start":224,"end":399,"exact":"A report by Equality, a US-based organisation with offices in New York, Nairobi, and London, reveals that many women are affected by this phenomenon, including many in Africa."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:9cc6352ed60a554b8919bc82213a49ca7c8ff33632fb74fbb925ade6a2f06847","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00003","start":0,"end":143,"exact":"In private online forums where women post under anonymity, distressing testimonies emerge about the violence they suffer within relationships. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:e6a0c64913aadde976221b4df2b6b4cb8e7ca0a159272e446e081844f4b88961","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00003","start":143,"end":256,"exact":"Out of respect and for the protection of those sharing their stories, no names or platform details are revealed. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:9e555ba509aef28ca7e91cea461575668125e62e7a1e81e4838904ae3a14d7ec","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00003","start":256,"end":431,"exact":"Behind these testimonies emerges a chilling reality: that of sexual relations imposed within marriage without the woman’s consent, in other words, the reality of marital rape."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:012e2a4e8d4fe43fa2e60db0161a3d15b10d1db64042f3f253d3de8c6c80e19d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00004","start":0,"end":82,"exact":"As violence against women becomes increasingly common, consent is being trampled. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:f08ac3d662e3b59f2f11278df647a2aef5bf4cf91505895f62a76944f63e7a1d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00004","start":82,"end":188,"exact":"The notion of “conjugal duty” still frequently outweighs a woman’s right to make decisions about her body."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:b9d5e12b93a292ca5ac360e3f06c489090eb5a50eaf90429814efcab3ff1b400","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00005","start":0,"end":156,"exact":"It is in these digital spaces, where distress is voiced and violence normalized, that discussion groups take shape, embodying a form of digital sisterhood. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:59844512358e21d9e925e3e905f1dada53c1f11c52b848d047dc75056c8d29d8","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00005","start":156,"end":331,"exact":"Providing room for listening, support, and open speech, these spaces enable women to challenge together the taboos that restrict their empowerment, online as well as offline. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:1ae656c577742405f8b44c81ec032d23f785eeb8c7478f98c26157a757923fa5","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00005","start":331,"end":465,"exact":"This safe space where women share their experiences underlines the urgency of an open and courageous debate on marital rape in Africa."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:804646e663aeb05b9d3378a0ebda4de888e605aa7c4ca8b116fe847a7593ac88","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00006","start":0,"end":39,"exact":"A cultural, religious, and legal debate"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:d503e8d6e83ccee9e1880b197a0727e052be9a8c52068d88ed37982e9e123fd5","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00007","start":0,"end":166,"exact":"In May 2025, the program “Midi Plus” on TFM Télévision Futur Média, based in Senegal, gave national exposure to Oustaz Modou Fall, a Muslim authority in the country. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:307c26edff1ddc23fbd575b466bd50b62edfb83b0ea523b3288e7316e9b859e8","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00007","start":166,"end":299,"exact":"This preacher claims that conjugal duty takes precedence over consent, thereby legitimizing sexual violence in the name of marriage. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:bbc5be8baf234b8269c78989bdd4d2a58f56431244210339558801e3465b7fa8","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00007","start":299,"end":328,"exact":"Speaking in Wolof, he stated:"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:a6151ede3b300ec514f3b45e0a8108c323e98d0f78c6ef53d7c174244dc3fc5a","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00008","start":0,"end":87,"exact":"> Gnouni loi bi néna sakh sa diabar so beugué teud akk mom té dacoroul daga ko violé . "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:d0d63b9f924086702672623d56c51e11540036e0053dba55a0dca81103a8f1c3","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00008","start":87,"end":104,"exact":"Pfff wakhi dof ! "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:1251a3f1c55a7679162a3a7e9ba9460f842c98c00b43b734d95e9fdd5af0d4d1","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00008","start":104,"end":323,"exact":"Sa diabar ga takk ko so farata Yallah akk souna Seydouna Mohamed , touki Pape Samba dem tournage soneu baye beugu dé gnibissi beugu teud ak sokhname gnouniko bouné dama soneu damadone fobéré (rires) ga forcéko viol le. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:e2f8495636a6902b0dbcef90e4a8d8d6c4b4bc5f01c0a12ca6ab8143c2ad7e01","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00008","start":323,"end":362,"exact":"Boudé lou amm la , lane moye texte bi. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:baa86ff849f15d68e2fc62ce5b563f3e69d2c5c0ee48bb4bfcf52f966c99c309","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00008","start":362,"end":370,"exact":"Si diné."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:f3221e0a8c2f5f305433b833408240bcd843da266a2c8a56deb16a9dff7d6fd5","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00009","start":0,"end":92,"exact":"> People say the law declares that if you force your wife to have sex, that counts as rape. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:9d34ae6507afec045b27e4b4361ce106854789b4815ced9dfce3b39cfa605cf6","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00009","start":92,"end":158,"exact":"Pfff — absurd, this is your wife, the one you married before God. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:15ae7e7ed601bacb99b9a33e018409a1552a1c2d5632ad0e56296ef07a23b69e","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00009","start":158,"end":276,"exact":"You travel, you work, Pape Samba [the host], you come back exhausted, you want to be with your wife, and she refuses. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:16a8df40fed3045cbc36a79e1d2988c1bc9c15d3cb724ac8adfbc626e34fd8d7","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00009","start":276,"end":343,"exact":"She says she’s tired, that she was doing the housework (laughter). "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:e8ac3e69ab7b63cf7e4b9a5bfedfb131f9753e97f06ddefaf7e625c7f2dd1c80","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00009","start":343,"end":372,"exact":"So if you insist, it’s rape? "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:75b88adcea469c65f650ab18322cd1ce73c85e3a8dcc273e0c7379b161824e2c","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00009","start":372,"end":427,"exact":"If that’s the case, which religious scripture says so? "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:7f42d19af9cbbb7e2b51296e5e48469f6128122811c802ea0e630a9a324d93dc","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00009","start":427,"end":458,"exact":"We must be cautious about this."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:3beb70eef767be6391db992756694b58478462ce498d54bfd14081aefbe8afef","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00010","start":0,"end":67,"exact":"The broadcast immediately sparked indignation across social media. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:bfa5f49b2f9629be8823c6974e9f182fbcbea18c77c20185f0052cce2038722d","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00010","start":67,"end":117,"exact":"On TikTok, activists and legal experts mobilized. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:8f70eff618a5e0b1ebb581b180421f75d9de5f8f62667a740d1421d2439b7798","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00010","start":117,"end":234,"exact":"The Xam Sa Droit page published a series of videos challenging Modou Fall’s statements against existing legislation. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:d92a32b3e4070ef56be8252372a325f0de26d3f5f459ebb2b6923c3b491327ec","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00010","start":234,"end":556,"exact":"Specifically, it points to Article 320 of Senegal’s Penal Code, which defines rape as any act of penetration “carried out through violence, coercion, threat or surprise.” This is a reminder that marriage does not take away any fundamental rights, and that refusing sex, even within a couple, remains an inalienable right. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:333beace22bdb3894a3bf4ad1853b8b8151bcaa19c6d9ab70b04c77fca7526cc","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00010","start":556,"end":681,"exact":"This effort at legal education was met with strong support on TikTok, as it put consent back at the center of the discussion."},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:988d7e5367b4c2eda9783b0d14effb6b706ade8810d1ab6f7bf746be2768e7cf","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00011","start":0,"end":30,"exact":"Voices were also raised on X. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:ff0bbe18746f9b2ea77a4d32096716739fa8e5003228e7dd718d66f5b3a728dd","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00011","start":30,"end":109,"exact":"Nabou Diop Lo, a lawyer and activist for women’s and children’s rights, posted:"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:8a889b55dcd4297d54b2039ad535ddc70d084eeaf48b66e861955ae837de0c19","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00012","start":0,"end":140,"exact":"> Rape, as defined in the Senegalese Penal Code, makes no distinction between rape committed within marriage and that committed outside it. "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:9535bc10a1daf38d038b4ccd6b39e8a7d57ee5f1554cfbd7c13a435feb9685ff","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00012","start":140,"end":201,"exact":"What matters is the victim’s consent. https://t.co/mJcYsxZunx"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:d2845de1af5e4c4fc6b695c5fe31b8247cbfe2da0aa5c6239499037afaa22ae0","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00013","start":0,"end":48,"exact":"> —Nabou Diop Lo🇸🇳 (@NabouDiopLo1) July 26, 2025"},{"@id":"urn:doxa:passage:2bf3f08e908e7268a0d86772a8b986150e465818ff28a811c0bc840d5ad6dc29","@type":["doxa:Passage","prov:Entity"],"fromSource":"urn:doxa:source:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8","blockId":"gv-843525-b00014","start":0,"end":120,"exact":"But how can a woman dare complain she's been raped when a religious figure claims that a wife’s “no” carries no weight? "},{"@id":"urn:doxa:decision:347d9db2158f42be67fad9b6551f26ca","@type":["doxa:Decision","prov:Entity"],"recordId":"347d9db2158f42be67fad9b6551f26ca","outcome":"does_not_meet","generatedBy":"urn:doxa:run:b2a2edd4ca7047128a5e433d8a874530","evaluates":"urn:doxa:criterion:anti-muslim-hostility:discrimination_claim:2026-03-operational-1:794fad83018ea1e0de86fe60ff7dec7a18160eddcba979e1750fdd782a8456f3","scoredUnit":"urn:doxa:unit:f081e0c7a57b05f9837952eec8d04cb8:u_c9eb23bc247977c00c54aaf5","attribution":"unknown","speaker":"Unknown","speakerStance":"not_applicable","documentStance":"not_applicable","proposition":"","hypothetical":false,"reviewStatus":"unreviewe